<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Frontend on My Blog - Sang</title><link>https://sang6386.github.io/myblog/tags/frontend/</link><description>Recent content in Frontend on My Blog - Sang</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 24 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sang6386.github.io/myblog/tags/frontend/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>JavaScript Essentials 1 – DOM và Event</title><link>https://sang6386.github.io/myblog/posts/javascript-essentials-1_3/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://sang6386.github.io/myblog/posts/javascript-essentials-1_3/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="-javascript-essentials-1--dom-và-event"&gt;💻 JavaScript Essentials 1 – DOM và Event&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bài học này giúp bạn &lt;strong&gt;tương tác với trang web&lt;/strong&gt; bằng cách thao tác DOM và xử lý sự kiện. Đây là bước quan trọng trước khi học framework như React, Vue hay Angular.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-1-dom-document-object-model"&gt;🧩 1. DOM (Document Object Model)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DOM&lt;/strong&gt; là cấu trúc cây đại diện cho HTML trong trình duyệt.&lt;br&gt;
Các node DOM bao gồm &lt;strong&gt;elements&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;attributes&lt;/strong&gt;, và &lt;strong&gt;text&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="-thao-tác-dom-cơ-bản"&gt;🔹 Thao tác DOM cơ bản&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Lấy element theo ID
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;heroTitle&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; document.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;getElementById&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;hero-title&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;heroTitle&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;textContent&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Chào mừng đến với Blog!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Lấy elements theo class
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;buttons&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; document.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;getElementsByClassName&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;btn-card&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Lặp qua NodeList
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Array.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;buttons&lt;/span&gt;).&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;forEach&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;btn&lt;/span&gt; =&amp;gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;btn&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;style&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;border&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;2px solid cyan&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="-thêm--xóa--thay-đổi-element"&gt;🔹 Thêm / Xóa / Thay đổi element&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Tạo element mới
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;newPara&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; document.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;createElement&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;p&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;newPara&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;textContent&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Đây là đoạn text mới thêm vào DOM.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;document.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;body&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;appendChild&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;newPara&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Xóa element
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;oldPara&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; document.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;querySelector&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;.old-text&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;oldPara&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;remove&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// Thay đổi style trực tiếp
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;heroTitle&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;style&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;color&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;#0ff&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;heroTitle&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;style&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;textShadow&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;0 0 10px #0ff&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="-2-event-handling-xử-lý-sự-kiện"&gt;🧩 2. Event Handling (Xử lý sự kiện)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Event là hành vi của người dùng (click, hover, input, submit).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>